        {
          "text": " Bwanyima baagira bati: Mwije tugiire Yerusaalemu omu naama; ahabw'okuba ebiragiro tibiriruga ha munyamurwa, nari enaama kuruga aha munyabwengye, n'obu kyakuba ekigambo ahari nabi. Mwije tumubeiherere, tumushiishe, turekye kweta aha kibambo kye na kimwe.",
